Hello everyone!
Here's the changelog of [b]version 1.1[/b]:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44442628/f03677eb6442d5f2f188d5aad07c4735f75ed4ab.gif[/img]

[list][*]Revamped "Options Menu", with new buttons such as VSync and language;
[*]Keybindings were added in a new section of the "Options Menu";
[*]Complete translation to Brazilian Portuguese (PTBR);
[*]Added a very small margin of error for jumping after falling from a ground (coyote jump);
[*]Now the settings and progress are saved in separate files;[/list]

Some bugs were also fixed:

[list][*]Extended the collision with vertical moving platforms, so now it's less likely to fall from them when standing too close to the edge;
[*]Many visual bugs;
[*]Some sound related issues;[/list]

I'll keep working on fixing stuff as much as I can, so any feedback is appreciated.
Thank you so much for playing Forest of Strays!

~ Akseru
